INTERFACE zif_stg_cds_source PUBLIC.
* A CDS entity as something the SADL DPC can read: one class per SQL view,
* generated by tools/cds2ddic.mjs, static FROM and dynamic everything else.

  METHODS read
    IMPORTING
      iv_where       TYPE string
      it_orderby     TYPE string_table
      it_fields      TYPE string_table OPTIONAL
      it_groupby     TYPE string_table OPTIONAL
    RETURNING
      VALUE(rr_data) TYPE REF TO data.

  METHODS create_line
    RETURNING
      VALUE(rr_line) TYPE REF TO data.

ENDINTERFACE.
